For you folks wondering about the spelling of this demon lord's name(after 
looking it up in an old version of AD&D monster guide ;-) ); it is YEENAGHU,
demon lord of gnolls. He always carries his flail around and can also do 
nasty damage to you with it(news to you, I'm sure! :-> ). BTW, his flail is 
supposed to also stun or confuse, tho I've yet to see that. Also, he is 
supposed to talk as well(note this for later versions, nethack.team). 

I first met him in 3.0j with my 14th level V. I was taking apart a water 
demon, when, much to my horror, he summoned Y!(should've realized that lower 
demons CAN summon the lord/prince types when they want to) Well, Y takes ME 
apart with that flail of his, and I've hated him ever since. 

OTOH, I much prefer him to Juiblex  >:-)


